# Only V2 sources and their tests are formatted.
#
# The remaining pre-V2 sources (<id>/<id>.ts) are either not migrated yet
# (sanitizeFileName, ssh, sub, warp) or references that compatibility tests
# rebuild the original behaviour from, often by slicing their text at comment
# markers (see scripts/aban-v2.test.js). Reformatting them would break those
# tests, so they keep their original bytes.
*/*.ts
!*/v2.ts
outdated/

